        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, refinery sludge, 89.5% water, to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, refinery sludge, 89.5% water, to landfarming
Inventoried waste contains 100% refinery sludge; . waste composition (wet, in ppm): upper heating value 4.732 MJ/kg; lower heating value 2.453 MJ/kg; H2O 888000; O 1017.1; H 13731; C 86452; S 508.54; N 1017.1; P 478.03; B n.a.; Cl n.a.; Br n.a.; F n.a.; I n.a.; Ag n.a.; As n.a.; Ba n.a.; Cd 10.171; Co 20.342; Cr n.a.; Cu 101.71; Hg 2.0342; Mn n.a.; Mo n.a.; Ni 152.56; Pb 457.69; Sb n.a.; Se n.a.; Sn n.a.; V n.a.; Zn 1017.1; Be n.a.; Sc n.a.; Sr n.a.; Ti n.a.; Tl n.a.; W n.a.; Si n.a.; Fe n.a.; Ca 7000; Al n.a.; K n.a.; Mg n.a.; Na n.a.; Share of carbon in waste that is biogenic 0%.; UUID: 07526ca5-a29d-4d26-86c7-242c21f09924
direct emissions from landfarming applications (100% to industrial soil). Burden for spreading process.
Location: undefined
Technology: direct spreading on industrial areas. No crop growing.
Time period: Waste composition as given in literature reference.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste compositions from literature data. 
Extrapolations: Spreading process approximated with vacuum tank spreader
Uncertainty adjustments: uncertainty of waste input composition data derived from generic formula GSD(c) = N*ln(c)+1.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_07526ca5-a29d-4d26-86c7-242c21f09924.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
